 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid ab7894cc-4d17-564a-a754-c1b6bff93da1))(text "18 guarded stimulation conductors, 17 measured RHD-side windows; conditional healthy-switch blanking is not proven isolation." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 11818255-5d3d-5076-a749-57decb8ce6c0))(text "All net labels are native electrical connections. Actual physical delay, leakage, failed switches and shared supplies remain bounded limitations." (at 20.32 391.16 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 275494e9-36a4-5959-98f8-b7d32bcf0903))(text "Independent phase cap, heartbeat watchdog, rail windows and deliberate rearm have different functions. No automatic retry or reverse pulse." (at 20.32 398.78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 3efe34c5-1104-54d8-ad5f-6fce17c2dde0)))
